# Copy to `.dev.vars` — used by `npm run preview`
# (OpenNext / Wrangler local runtime). Not used by `next dev`.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined at build time from .env.local,
# so they are NOT needed here. Only add server-side secrets.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
